  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h4>触及更多家庭</h4>\n<p>宜家零售销售额已达383亿欧元，也就是说，人们已利用宜家产品打造出越来越多的可爱卧室、漂亮厨房和巧妙的储物装置。</p>\n<p><strong>宜家零售销售额*：</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>383 亿欧元<br /></strong></h2>\n<p>*不含消费税。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/82/05/8205795eeb0ab1cf1a1cd165934d5ce4.png"
